---
description: Conventions for the React client
globs: ["client/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Functional components with hooks only.
- Tailwind CSS utility classes; no separate CSS files unless a Phase explicitly
  asks for custom keyframes/animations.
- Axios wrapped in a single client/src/api.js — no ad hoc fetch calls scattered
  across components.
- Currency values arrive from the API in paise; format to ₹ only inside a
  shared formatMoney() helper, used everywhere money is displayed.